@startuml
actor User
participant "Unified shell" as Web
participant "Workspace API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB

Web -> API: GET /workspace/navigation
API -> DB: Count recipient unread notifications
API --> Web: Navigation + badge
User -> Web: Open Notifications
Web -> API: GET /workspace/notifications
API -> DB: tenant_id + recipient_user_id
API --> Web: Addressed notifications
User -> Web: Mark read
Web -> API: PATCH /notifications/{id}
API -> DB: Verify exact recipient then set read_at
API --> Web: Updated notification
@enduml
